{"v":1,"id":"8fbab5fafa6c","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"From the dust you formed us, in mercy you called","s":11.46,"e":18.86},{"t":"When we wandered in darkness, still you carried it all","s":18.86,"e":25.76},{"t":"You came low in glory to lift us above","s":25.76,"e":32.46},{"t":"Oh Yahushua, our only one","s":33.06,"e":36.82},{"t":"Our first and only love","s":36.82,"e":39.82},{"t":"You walked with the broken","s":43.48,"e":46.56},{"t":"You healed with Your hand","s":46.56,"e":49.76},{"t":"You spoke truth and mercy","s":49.76,"e":53.6},{"t":"And taught us to stand","s":53.6,"e":56.54},{"t":"You called twelve in silence","s":57.1,"e":60.66},{"t":"To follow your flame","s":60.66,"e":63.34},{"t":"Now we walk in your footsteps","s":64.04,"e":67.26},{"t":"And honor your name","s":67.26,"e":70.26},{"t":"All tears wiped away","s":74.14,"e":77.18},{"t":"By the hand of the King","s":77.18,"e":80.76},{"t":"No more sorrow, no more pain","s":80.76,"e":84.46},{"t":"Just the joy that You bring","s":84.46,"e":87.66},{"t":"You have written our names","s":87.66,"e":91.12},{"t":"In the Lamb's book of life","s":91.78,"e":94.54},{"t":"You have conquered the grave","s":94.54,"e":97.76},{"t":"You have ended the strife","s":98.42,"e":101.66},{"t":"All tears wiped away","s":101.66,"e":104.86},{"t":"In the light of your face","s":108.1,"e":112.44},{"t":"Every tribe and nation","s":115.78,"e":118.92},{"t":"Shall bow and confess","s":118.92,"e":121.76},{"t":"The name above all names","s":121.76,"e":125.96},{"t":"Yahuwah is blessed","s":125.96,"e":128.68},{"t":"The heavens resounded","s":130.24,"e":132.78},{"t":"The angels proclaim","s":132.78,"e":135.4},{"t":"All creation now worships","s":135.4,"e":140.12},{"t":"And blesses Your name","s":140.12,"e":142.76},{"t":"Worthy is the Lamb","s":148.88,"e":151.34},{"t":"Who was slain and now lives","s":151.34,"e":154.9},{"t":"To Him be the glory","s":155.52,"e":158.4},{"t":"All power He gives","s":158.4,"e":161.84